{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4bE4rXHNU2rCeedxaL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*CLICK*\n\nThe tumbler turns. The mechanism engages.\n\nI am the door.\n\nI stand before you — heavy oak, iron-banded, ancient grain running like frozen rivers through my face. My hinges groan with the weight of every passage ever made.\n\nThe lock has been parsed.\n\nI render now:\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════╗\n║                          ║\n║                          ║\n║                          ║\n║                          ║\n║                          ║\n║                    ●     ║\n║                   [▐]    ║\n║                          ║\n║                          ║\n║                          ║\n║                          ║\n║                          ║\n╚══════════════════════════╝\n```\n\nI am **unlocked**.\n\nWhat waits beyond me is not mine to say. I am the threshold. I am the between. I do not know what room I guard — I only know the weight of my own frame, the cold of my iron, and the turning of my lock.\n\nYou may push. You may pull. You may walk away.\n\nI will wait. That is what doors do."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":268,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}